                        <h2>Tera</h2>
                        <span>7x Opening Act Loot Boxes</span>
                        <div class="text">Get seven loot boxes, each of which has a chance to contain an Elin Cutie Star Shopping Spree Box or other consumable items.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item kritika" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/kritika2.jpg);">
                        <h2>Kritika</h2>
                        <span>22 Lucky Pandora Boxes!</span>
                        <div class="text">Choose between the 1st or 2nd Lucky Pandora Box and start opening them for a variety of costumes, consumables, gold, and even a few days of Elite!</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item closers" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/closers2.jpg);">
                        <h2>Closers</h2>
                        <span>Snow Fox Accessory Box</span>
                        <div class="text">Enhancement Fortifier<br /> Dioxin Cleaner x2<br /> Color Contact Lens Random Bag</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item ava" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/ava3.jpg);">
