                        <span>Fortune Star Pack Items!</span>
                        <div style="font-size: 16px;" class="text">Get the second tier of bonus sidearms and character skins from when each of the Fortune Star bundles was originally on sale, plus the items from the 2200 and 1000 AVA EMP reward tiers!</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="deal">
            <div class="cost" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Prices/20.jpg)">
                <div class="promo"><span>10%</span><br />Bonus + Gifts</div>
                <% if @blackfriday %><a href="/enmasse/emp" class="btn">Buy EMP</a><% end %>
            </div>
            <div class="wrap">
                <button class="show-btn hidden"><div class="before-arrow down"></div>Show Gift Details<div class="after-arrow down"></button>
                <div class="deals hidden">
                    <div class="item tera" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/tera1.jpg);">
                        <h2>Tera</h2>
                        <span>3x Opening Act Loot Boxes</span>
                        <div class="text">Get three loot boxes, each of which has a chance to contain an Elin Cutie Star Shopping Spree Box or other consumable items.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item kritika" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/kritika2.jpg);">
                        <h2>Kritika</h2>
                        <span>10 Lucky Pandora Boxes!</span>
                        <div class="text">Choose between the 1st or 2nd Lucky Pandora Box and start opening them for a variety of costumes, consumables, gold, and even a few days of Elite!</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item closers" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/closers2.jpg);">
                        <h2>Closers</h2>
                        <span>Snow Fox Accessory Box</span>
                        <div class="text">Ultimate Equalizer <br /> Color Contact Lens Random Bag</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item ava" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/ava4.jpg);">
                        <h2>Ava</h2>
                        <span>Fortune Star Pack Items!</span>
                        <div style="font-size: 16px;" class="text">Get the first tier of bonus sidearms from when each of the Fortune Star bundles was originally on sale, plus the M67 En Masse from the 1000 EMP reward tier!</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="deal">
            <div class="cost" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Prices/10.jpg)">
                <div class="promo" style="text-align: center;">Includes<br />Digital Gifts</div>
                <% if @blackfriday %><a href="/enmasse/emp" class="btn">Buy EMP</a><% end %>
            </div>
            <div class="wrap">
                <button class="show-btn hidden"><div class="before-arrow down"></div>Show Gift Details<div class="after-arrow down"></button>
                <div class="deals hidden">
                    <div class="item tera" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/tera1.jpg);">
                        <h2>Tera</h2>
                        <span>1x Opening Act Loot Box</span>
                        <div class="text">Get a loot box that has a chance to contain an Elin Cutie Star Shopping Spree Box or other consumable items.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item kritika" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/kritika2.jpg);">
                        <h2>Kritika</h2>
                        <span>3 Lucky Pandora Boxes!</span>
                        <div class="text">Choose between the 1st or 2nd Lucky Pandora Box and start opening them for a variety of costumes, consumables, gold, and even a few days of Elite!</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item closers" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/closers3.jpg);">
                        <h2>Closers</h2>
                        <div class="text">Resurrection Capsule x11<br /> Color Contact Lens Random Bag</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item ava" style="background-image: url(https://static.enmasse.com/images/BlackFriday/EMP/Deals/ava5.jpg);">
                        <h2>Ava</h2>
                        <span>EME Grenades!</span>
                        <div class="text">M67 ENMASSE (Permanent) These grenades leave a distinctive blue logo on the ground after they explode.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <div class="disclaimer-faq">Log in to each game following EMP purchase is required to receive your gift. See the <a href="http://support.enmasse.com/tera/black-friday-sale-2017">Black Friday FAQ</a> for more details.</div>
    </main>


